2. You must not use, modify, or distribute the software for any commercial purpose, including any activity intended to generate revenue or commercial advantage.

3. If you distribute the software, or any work based on the software, you must do so under this license or a license with identical terms.

4. If you distribute the software, you must provide a copy of this license and retain all copyright and other proprietary notices.

Patent Grant
Each contributor grants you a patent license for the software on these conditions:

